    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d21-a5">

                <pb facs="0146" n="38" xml:id="pg38"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5 in No. 448.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Senhor
                            Freire.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the united States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-06-01"><hi rendition="#italic">June 1,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge receipt of
                    your excellency’s note of the 31st ultimo, with information that the inspectors
                    of customs have been instructed to dispatch free of all duties the products
                    mentioned in article 1 of decree No. 1338 of February 5, 1891. This
                    determination on the part of the Brazilian Government to vigorously maintain the
                    conditions of the reciprocity arrangement will be duly appreciated by my
                    Government.</p>
                <p>Thanking your excellency for your prompt personal attention to the matter, I
                    again assure you, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. H. Conger</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
